    "title": "Frame a short interval with 一会儿 and 不一会儿",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-time-p04-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Frame a short interval with 一会儿 and 不一会儿",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Before a predicate, 一会儿 places an action a little while in the future. 不一会儿 introduces an event that followed a short interval. After a verb, the separately learned duration use measures how long the action lasts.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我一会儿去学校。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yīhuìr qù xuéxiào 。",
                "meaning": "I will go to school in a little while.",
                "audio": "60012022ba70c0c461b0018c71bf6a84f9320197887ff88d7777df896d575036"
              },
              {
                "text": "不一会儿，他来了。",
                "pinyin": "bùyīhuìr ， tā lái le 。",
                "meaning": "Before long, he arrived.",
                "audio": "e21c8d7cb5f4f60099739ea0f406bfaafa15ae759c532e26098cef137bc53608"
              },
              {
                "text": "我等一会儿。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ děng yīhuìr 。",
                "meaning": "I will wait for a little while.",
                "audio": "0325bce666dc62ff7f6ba5816c6c37501f227d2dbbed81c5ac421301fc4a30b9"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
